# Reaches Rebel's package `tracing`, so that `heroes test` on this file runs
# the tests of its face and its private modules (spec § 12). It reads the W3C
# Recommendation's own `traceparent` and writes it back, touching no network.

use <rebel>/tracing

function main()
    match tracing.parse_traceparent("00-0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-b7ad6b7169203331-01")
        .ok c  => print(tracing.format_traceparent(c))
        .err e => print(e.msg)
